{
    "name": "建築材料",
    "category": "tfg:craftsmanship",
    "icon": "tfc:wattle/white",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#primitive_materials)原始材料$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#thatch)茅草$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#mud_bricks)泥磚$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#wattle_and_daub)板條與塗料$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#advanced_materials)進階材料$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#alabaster)雪花石膏$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#bricks_and_mortar)磚塊與砂漿$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#block_interactions)方塊互動$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#roof_building)建造屋頂$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#modern)現代材料$()",
            "title": "索引",
            "anchor": "index"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "primitive_materials",
            "title": "原始材料",
            "text": "在遊戲初期，建築可能是一大挑戰，因為許多堅固的建築方塊需要金屬工具才能取得。不過，有幾種建築方塊只用石製工具就能取得。$(br2)更多$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#advanced_materials)進階建築方塊$()則需要金屬工具才能取得。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "thatch",
            "text": "只要有一把$(l:craftsmanship/sticks_and_stones)石刀$()，就能破壞類似植物的方塊取得$(thing)乾草$()。乾草可以用來合成一種非常簡單的建築材料：$(thing)茅草$()。茅草是一種不受重力影響的輕量方塊，但玩家和其他實體可以直接穿過它！需要時也可以將它合成回$(thing)乾草$()。",
            "title": "茅草"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "anchor": "mud_bricks",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/soil/loam_drying_bricks",
            "title": "泥磚",
            "text": "$(thing)泥巴$()可以在地面上、某些水域底下、低海拔的沼澤環境中找到，也可以按下$(item)$(k:key.drop)$()將泥土丟進水裡直接製成。加上一點$(thing)乾草$()，就能合成$()濕泥磚$()。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:multimultiblock",
            "text": "將濕泥磚放在乾燥的地面上，一天後它們就會硬化成$(thing)泥磚$()。",
            "multiblocks": [
                {
                    "pattern": [
                        [
                            "X"
                        ],
                        [
                            "Y"
                        ],
                        [
                            "0"
                        ]
                    ],
                    "mapping": {
                        "X": "tfc:drying_bricks/loam[count=4,dried=false]",
                        "Y": "tfc:grass/loam"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "pattern": [
                        [
                            "X"
                        ],
                        [
                            "Y"
                        ],
                        [
                            "0"
                        ]
                    ],
                    "mapping": {
                        "X": "tfc:drying_bricks/loam[count=4,dried=true]",
                        "Y": "tfc:grass/loam"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/soil/loam_mud_bricks",
            "title": "泥磚方塊",
            "text": "這些乾燥的泥磚可以合成$(thing)泥磚方塊$()。如果你想要的話，也可以做成$(thing)階梯$()、$(thing)半磚$()或$(thing)牆$()。泥磚方塊可以用鏟子挖掘。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "wattle_and_daub",
            "text": "$(thing)板條$()與$(thing)塗料$()是一種多用途的建築和裝飾方塊。$(br)$(thing)板條$()可以合成並放置，但它很容易破壞，而且玩家和生物可以穿過它。可以用$(thing)塗料$()強化，使其變成實心方塊。$(br)要讓$(thing)板條$()變成實心，首先必須將它編織，也就是在結構中加入木棍。",
            "title": "板條與塗料"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/wattle_weave.png"
            ],
            "text": "$(thing)編織$()板條需要四根木棍。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "你隨時都可以在兩條對角線以及頂部和底部加入木棍。手持一根$(thing)木棍$()按下$(item)$(k:key.use)$()即可加入木棍。選擇面上不同的位置，即可改變木棍要加在板條的哪個部位。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/wattle_add_stick.png"
            ],
            "text": "在板條中加入木棍。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/wattle_add_daub.png"
            ],
            "text": "對$(thing)編織板條$()使用$(thing)塗料會形成實心方塊。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/wattle_stained.png"
            ],
            "text": "接著可以對它使用$(thing)染料$()來$(thing)上色$()。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:multimultiblock",
            "text": "板條與塗料的製作過程。",
            "multiblocks": [
